<title>UK: Result of ICM poll on UK election not known - paper.</title>
<headline>Result of ICM poll on UK election not known - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>An ICM opinion poll on the British election, to be published overnight in the Guardian newspaper, has not yet been completed, the newspaper said.</p>
<p>Rumours in financial markets said the poll would show a sharp cut in Labour's lead from 15 points in the last ICM poll.</p>
